  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Help Empower 500 Rural Youth and Women</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will empower 500 underprivileged youth and women from Devashtich District of Tajikistan through establishment of a resource centre in School 10 of Ghazantarak Village, which agreed to provide premises for free. The resource centre will empower rural youth and women to get necessary skills and knowledge to find jobs, start their own businesses and create jobs for others. To do this, the center will organize courses and training workshops  on the topics of concern.</narrative>
  </description>
